== Description ==

'''Chrome Bullet Tip''' is a refined metal ingot in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Furnace]]. It appears as an ingredient in 6 downstream recipes at the [[Gunsmith Workbench]], including [[7.62x39mm Chrome]], [[7.62x51mm Chrome]], [[7.62x54mm Chrome]], [[9x19mm Chrome]], [[D45 Chrome]], [[5.56x45mm Chrome]]. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

